                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At an interview authorities profess to think United States has ulterior purpose
                    in sending ship. Say it will obstruct autonomy, produce excitement, and most
                    probably a demonstration. Ask that it is not done until they can get
                    instructions from Madrid, and say that if for friendly motives, as claimed,
                    delay unimportant.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
